# 版本变更说明

## 5.3.0-104（2026-07-25）

|-------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
|**新增特性** * 新增[情绪/压力自动检测开关](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/huaweihealth-Guides/set-and-query-emotion-switch-0000002526499302)、[皮肤温度连续测量开关](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/huaweihealth-Guides/set-and-query-skin-temp-continuous-switch-0000002526501500)、[体温偏高提醒开关](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/huaweihealth-Guides/set-and-query-elevated-temp-warning-switch-0000002557581359)、[体温过高提醒开关](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/huaweihealth-Guides/set-and-query-high-temp-alert-switch-0000002526661442)、[高原关爱自动监护开关](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/huaweihealth-Guides/set-and-query-high-land-blood-oxygen-switch-0000002526499306)、[脉搏波心律失常自动检测开关](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/huaweihealth-Guides/set-and-query-ppg-period-switch-0000002526659256)、[脉搏波心律失常提醒开关](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/huaweihealth-Guides/set-and-query-ppg-notify-switch-0000002557659125)、[睡眠呼吸暂停检测开关](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/huaweihealth-Guides/set-and-query-osa-switch-0000002526659252)、[设置息屏上报功能](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/huaweihealth-Guides/set-screen-off-data-report-0000002580094292)。 * [睡眠数据](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/huaweihealth-Guides/query-historical-sleep-data-0000002342676394)新增睡眠期间生理指标数据。 * 新增开放健康数据：[情绪数据](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/huaweihealth-Guides/query-emotion-data-0000002557579167)、[心率变异性数据](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/huaweihealth-Guides/query-hrv-data-0000002526521496)、[逐搏测量数据](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/huaweihealth-Guides/query-rri-data-0000002557601347)、[脉搏波心律失常PPG数据](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/huaweihealth-Guides/query-arrhythmia-ppg-data-0000002526499308)、[微体检报告](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/huaweihealth-Guides/query-health-glance-report-data-0000002557659127)。 * 新增开放运动数据：[活动记录](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/huaweihealth-Guides/query-activity-record-0000002526681438)。 * 新增开放日常活动数据：[当日静息热量消耗数据](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/huaweihealth-Guides/query-today-resting-calories-0000002557841549)。 * 新增开放传感器数据：[实时光传感数据](https://developer.huawei.com/consumer/cn/doc/huaweihealth-Guides/subscribe-ppg-sensor-0000002527132100)。|

## 历史版本

